OL,3,GNEWSAMan suffers 'significant injuries'
OL,4,Ain coastal cliff fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man had to be airlifted to hospital
OL,7,Fwith "significant injuries" after
OL,8,Ffalling from cliffs on the south of
OL,9,FScotland coast.
OL,11,FHM Coastguard teams from Kirkcudbright,
OL,12,FPortling, and the Isle of Whithorn,
OL,13,Fwere called out to the incident at
OL,14,Fabout 10:00 on Saturday.
OL,16,FThe injured man had called for
OL,17,Fassistance after the fall in the area
OL,18,Fbetween Balcary and Rascarrel.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
