OL,3,GNEWSAMan suffers 'significant injuries'
OL,4,Ain coastal cliff fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was given first aid before being
OL,7,Fwinched to safety by the coastguard
OL,8,Fhelicopter and then airlifted to
OL,9,Fhospital in Glasgow.
